    "about_the_game": "<strong>Xentripetal Force</strong> is an action game that let's you and your friends experience a competitive survival match that takes place in outer space.<br><br><strong>Modes:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survival Mode<br></li><li>Insane Survival Mode<br></li><li>Scoring Mode<br></li><li>Insane Scoring Mode<br></li><li>1 Ball Mode<br></li><li>XL Ball Mode</li></ul><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 Playable Characters.<br></li><li>Smart AI<br></li><li>Randomized environment</li></ul>",
